WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.925
One amount can be a fraction, a decimal or a percentage.

2
00:00:04.702 --> 00:00:08.202
Three quarters of the bar. How many of a hundred squares?

3
00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:13.980
Seventy five out of a hundred: nought point seven five, or seventy five percent.
